TITLE Water (150C) equilibrated with fixed-pressure gas phase (1 atm total)
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7
    pe 4
    -water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -temperature 150
    -pressure 1
    CH4(g)  0.4  10
    CO2(g)  0.4  10
    NH3(g)  0.2   5
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -pH true
END
